# SEQ skips the exit (1), ADD makes x 1 (2), JMP back (3), SEQ does not skip (4), JMP leaves (5),
# MOV marks done (A of cell 6) at 6. A loop that never left would never mark it.
golden: bbctests/examples/while_eq.bbc
cell 2 6 DAT.F #0, #1
cell 5 6 DAT.F #0, #1
cell 6 6 DAT.F #1, #1
cell 50 6 DAT.F #1, #1
alive 100
